artway through, `*dst` is set to NULL but `*out_length` is NOT updated (it remains whatever it was before - which should be 0 from the memset). OK so that's fine.\n\nLet me look at a DIFFERENT potential source. What about the response encoding? When `UA_MessageContext_encode` encodes the response, if the response includes DiagnosticInfo that references inner diagnostic info...\n\nWait, actually the commit ac0d94217 is about DiagnosticInfo ENCODING. Let me look at what exactly was fixed:",
